<title>UK: Persona up after Sunday Times comment.</title>
<headline>Persona up after Sunday Times comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Persona Plc shares were marked higher on Monday after a recommendation on the stock in the Sunday Times' &quot;Inside Track&quot; column, dealers said.</p>
<p>Shares in the distributor of computer network and communications equipment were up 13p at 390-1/2 by 0901 GMT.</p>
<p>The Sunday Times said the company was making good progress integrating its Top Log acquisition and that the stock deserved a higher rating.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
